## LeadAdsApi

### Delete lead ads subscription
## Delete lead ads subscription
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/leads/subscriptions/{{subscription_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Get lead ads subscription by ID
## Get lead ads subscription by ID
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/leads/subscriptions/{{subscription_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Get lead ads subscriptions
## Get lead ads subscriptions
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/leads/subscriptions?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Create lead ads subscription
## Create lead ads subscription
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/leads/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

